### ===========================================
### INSTRUMENT CRUD APIS
### ===========================================

### 1. Get All Instruments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create Instrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentCode": "INSTR001",
  "name": "Máy xét nghiệm sinh hóa tự động",
  "status": "ONLINE"
}

###

### 3. Get Instrument by Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/INSTR001
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get Instrument by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Update Instrument
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/INSTR001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Máy xét nghiệm sinh hóa cao cấp",
  "status": "ONLINE",
  "reagentStatus": "OK"
}

###

### 6. Heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/INSTR001/heartbeat

###

### 7. Get Instrument Status (with current run)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/INSTR001/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Delete Instrument
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/INSTR001

###


### ===========================================
### CARTRIDGE MANAGEMENT APIS
### ===========================================

### 1. Get Cartridges on Instrument
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/cartridges/INSTR001
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Load Cartridges to Instrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/cartridges/load
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: load-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "instrumentCode": "INSTR001",
  "lines": [
    {
      "skuId": 1,
      "lotId": 101,
      "qty": 50.0,
      "minLevel": 10.0
    },
    {
      "skuId": 2,
      "lotId": 102,
      "qty": 30.0,
      "minLevel": 5.0
    },
    {
      "skuId": 3,
      "lotId": 103,
      "qty": 100.0,
      "minLevel": 20.0
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3. Return Cartridges from Instrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/cartridges/return
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: return-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "instrumentCode": "INSTR001",
  "lines": [
    {
      "skuId": 1,
      "lotId": 101,
      "qty": 5.0
    }
  ]
}

###


### ===========================================
### RUN MANAGEMENT APIS
### ===========================================

@bookingId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### 1. Start Run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "instrumentCode": "INSTR001"
}

###

### 2. Get Run Detail
@runId = 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/{{runId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Drop CSV (Generate Results and Send to TestOrder)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/{{runId}}/drop-csv

###

### 4. Complete Run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/{{runId}}/complete

###


### ===========================================
### SIMULATION API (Testing)
### ===========================================

### Run Full Simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/simulations/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "instrumentCode": "INSTR001"
}

###


### ===========================================
### FULL WORKFLOW TEST
### ===========================================

### Step 1: Create Instrument
# @name createInstrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentCode": "TEST001",
  "name": "Test Machine for Demo",
  "status": "ONLINE"
}

###

### Step 2: Load Cartridges
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/cartridges/load
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: test-load-001

{
  "instrumentCode": "TEST001",
  "lines": [
    {
      "skuId": 1,
      "lotId": 101,
      "qty": 100.0,
      "minLevel": 10.0
    },
    {
      "skuId": 2,
      "lotId": 102,
      "qty": 80.0,
      "minLevel": 15.0
    },
    {
      "skuId": 3,
      "lotId": 103,
      "qty": 120.0,
      "minLevel": 20.0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Step 3: Check Cartridge Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/cartridges/TEST001
Accept: application/json

###

### Step 4: Check Instrument Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/TEST001/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Step 5: Start Run (use real booking from TestOrder)
# @name startRun
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "instrumentCode": "TEST001"
}

###

### Step 6: Drop CSV Results
@testRunId = {{startRun.response.body.runId}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/{{testRunId}}/drop-csv

###

### Step 7: Complete Run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/runs/{{testRunId}}/complete

###

### Step 8: Check Remaining Cartridges
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/instrument/cartridges/TEST001
Accept: application/json

###

### Step 9: Cleanup - Delete Test Instrument
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/instruments/TEST001

###
